    // 1. Best-Fit logic: Penalize large post_residuals (dead space)
    // 2. Harmonic/Modulo logic: Penalize residuals that create 'unusable' gaps for common item sizes
    // We prioritize bins that leave very small residuals (potential to be filled later)
    // or perfectly empty residuals (0).

